#. native-sha256: 7a4352e3321f8b95db59662bdf9249cb62dc754ed68e57b2b7f04a1a65e21c36
#. default-sha256: b6204e42f02f37429f5efa85f44de25e82827bcb8eae15a0d067d7a8beef9b42
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A96CAE13_9C7E_4730_98AB_0871D301A47C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"The next thing I know, I’m sinking into a vast void."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Tout à coup, je sombre dans le vaste vide."

#: scenario7:scenario7_90291295_72F6_4C51_BFC6_381BD6CEF353
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4dff834e86ae1a200289caf4a7b032a4ef1281fe0532657c51dc29ee8b544af
#. default-sha256: 358bc195b681a8624bde759c0baca4cea7555ab9980052fa2d80badd9020cfeb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_90291295_72F6_4C51_BFC6_381BD6CEF353"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Darkness cuffs my hands and legs, restricting my movement."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les ténèbres m’entravent les pieds et les mains, restreignant le moindre de mes mouvements."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2AD5BC36_5471_4DAF_8C37_9DDE094511FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 827cbe1aa9ba2af3f877a300c5e381cfe1941497acd2c3deca2cadae77f6810d
#. default-sha256: f76f9b2b826ec729c79b3f4b965a2b6a550e2717a6389bf936a3ad40e14fab14
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2AD5BC36_5471_4DAF_8C37_9DDE094511FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Images of the past I had kept buried away for so long stream past me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Des images du passé que j’avais gardé enfouies pendant si longtemps défilent devant moi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BA656386_6B5A_407B_A461_559136048884
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd49a62341c899dc503f35c62ea96933c87ff29c776a5c780c6589d721e79de3
#. default-sha256: ef549438e3c578147084fe93150680c95f937e735821e027f371579cd2c13e0b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BA656386_6B5A_407B_A461_559136048884"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This isn’t how I wanted it to happen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je ne voulais pas que ça se passe ainsi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F4B7AAC7_8F40_40E8_B4DC_DAA38BFB6CEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c97078334db1353c68597661c3f001a325ea8990353728df134ded373ececb75
#. default-sha256: d779d2dfccc55555f1ce5432b35e24c3d14a077cc6c4f2f502e21b10ae26fb75
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F4B7AAC7_8F40_40E8_B4DC_DAA38BFB6CEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not coming from my own mouth, but being laid bare for all to see without my consent."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Que ce soit étalé devant tous, contre mon gré, et non que je le raconte avec mes propres "
"mots."

#: scenario7:scenario7_88540E0B_4C1F_4535_B178_8FF75C778400
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e66fe0404978695f459ca858e3208be02a108153b49ad001cb88a6b9f1c8e73
#. default-sha256: d4d557d65fefceb5584db0e1683f1955af4c6142b88c3ca63d5a264062d41755
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_88540E0B_4C1F_4535_B178_8FF75C778400"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t how I wanted her to find out about my secret.⟪k:1⟫About my shameful history."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce n’est pas comme cela que je voulais qu’elle découvre mon secret.⟪k:1⟫Mon passé honteux."

#: scenario7:scenario7_011499B5_A734_4A7F_BADA_EECA71EE1258
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cda1d1810537369a1c4d3997f16cda9f934871e38c378088fff53607c9d01fc
#. default-sha256: be75e3d2a6625fe4e841f5d9c6c48d1552aa2916a6c7a738529bd8b51cb91de7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_011499B5_A734_4A7F_BADA_EECA71EE1258"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I warned you, my dear.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I told you you didn’t want to reclaim your old self."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je t’avais prévenu, mon cher.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je t’avais dit que tu ne voudrais pas retrouver ton "
"identité."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DF7DD3A0_BC0F_4C5C_B3F1_B44B778C1EB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16d056704528a13f7802b582b693cc4ed99f9a8ba0d679b9388d7b34dcd133a5
#. default-sha256: 3283c182e080b4fa5903bb95553fc25a60fdb54c2f66e864644cb7df95de3a03
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DF7DD3A0_BC0F_4C5C_B3F1_B44B778C1EB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you had simply let it be, you wouldn’t be here now, forced to relive it all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si tu m’avais simplement laissé faire, tu n’en serais pas là aujourd’hui, forcé de tout "
"revivre."

#: scenario7:scenario7_26AA5245_B7EF_4A45_A834_0B33AE52C6D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 614f979597622beab20836b315af7343637fff1470a05fc3bc86e539c24cc904
#. default-sha256: a78df60ad26e5f3cba9d12646a9276e354a8b1414594d03ef0b36f942c770cbc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_26AA5245_B7EF_4A45_A834_0B33AE52C6D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now do you understand?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The tale I spun behind the fourth door...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was as "
"much for you as it was for her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tu comprends, à présent ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le conte que je t’ai présenté derrière la quatrième "
"porte...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...était autant pour toi que pour elle."

#: scenario7:scenario7_549F9556_6FFA_41FE_A2D5_02D9825633E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a16eb33358e117e805bad46edd2c1c02b3e3da44be6aadf9a957d50520350aa4
#. default-sha256: ce7ccc783c5abf75e53b538940ac4b4fc132251428da25ea9b5ff14b43223825
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_549F9556_6FFA_41FE_A2D5_02D9825633E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There, you were a young man with a sad fate,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dans cette histoire-là, tu étais un jeune homme au triste destin,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_81DF8018_C7B1_483D_A0A1_1FAD77647BF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14f172543cbc9c3410954f0e6c914f3b14d0153e571fadcc527b685d0a9b5348
#. default-sha256: a0a93ea86a8de0cbcffdb6811e60e48ae8f7224fdaf3cce2a287a7c39e7e95fe
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_81DF8018_C7B1_483D_A0A1_1FAD77647BF9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but you met a wonderful woman, fell in love with her,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫mais tu rencontrais une femme merveilleuse, tu tombais amoureux d’elle,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_782DC1D8_EFC8_40C7_A723_4689DB8A74F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b50fcff2a33f9cd059f8b08da6583d5fa5486cb93e72cb02b3793a1bfeed554
#. default-sha256: aabd169d7bc107143704816a640a2a5e9c98385a4a2221f9d8653a2413f7ae01
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_782DC1D8_EFC8_40C7_A723_4689DB8A74F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and then died in the arms of tragedy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫et tu succombais à la tragédie."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6A27B7F1_BF1F_48E8_9185_3B6D50AA5242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 534399cfd3c1c17fe53587f00234810e7867d2f66bf6d575eabf5b93d5ad1cc3
#. default-sha256: cad5d4e6f0618761267516d272ccefe6389268cfc5fdec3c26be64caabffb2c9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6A27B7F1_BF1F_48E8_9185_3B6D50AA5242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sequence of events is not far from the truth, but I was able to turn it into something "
"enchanting and beautiful."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’enchaînement d’événements n’est pas très éloigné de la vérité mais j’ai réussi à les "
"transformer en quelque chose d’enchanteur et de magique."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7DAC9D9F_91D2_4E0A_B9B9_ACA1FDE69FA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b0fd475c6920959f042c03886594a1917fc12ef79f5263cf3a6ee84780c9fc8
