msgid "⟪k:0⟫But can you honestly blame her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais peux-tu honnêtement lui jeter la pierre ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AC7D6F8D_2FF8_4974_8F51_9EE8A1E9B614
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a366d2fc718820824247221ae4da189cbcfdc87b138c4b0019492556aa70d0a
