msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ABDA3FD6_2F53_4B77_8D55_365B3A717DC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We’d long since left paved roads behind. The carriage rocked back and forth as it proceeded "
"down the rough dirt path."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On avait depuis longtemps délaissé les routes pavées. La voiture bringuebalait sur le chemin "
"cahoteux et poussiéreux."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F0C6902E_68FE_4483_BBB0_C7DD7DF9C42B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5e9d2aef59b801ca0eff6c9b1afcce8dc5238d37d2fba800fae0de9570b3295
#. default-sha256: c0f1ce4f90ca0176a1e416843d3de3f9902e9282da79ec402fd4dfba6f84202a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F0C6902E_68FE_4483_BBB0_C7DD7DF9C42B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For hours, I stared through the window as unfamiliar scenery flowed past."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je passai des heures à regarder par la fenêtre, à voir défiler des paysages inconnus."

#: scenario7:scenario7_79A48CB2_9C49_44A6_B40B_44E15C9C445D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5391ab5ebdcddb02ac02a106bae721e4944ab09b967a7ab63426ae4ef520adf
#. default-sha256: 1f1350c46f74faca7b1d13985aab30f328a4b4f22d5325093a01c1b772916d6a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_79A48CB2_9C49_44A6_B40B_44E15C9C445D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Eventually, a fog settled over the area, making it difficult to discern night from day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Au bout d’un moment, le brouillard s’installa sur la région et je peinai à distinguer le "
"jour de la nuit."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0E088A47_52C1_4581_B41B_BF40C33F08E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a06f03216a11cbace77df0325b9752034cf92a9e6abd3232f28792a2ee4c04f0
#. default-sha256: 9749897446213f5eb0a093d73ee6e3d6cca80ef19b17e071b6af7ae6c37263b5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0E088A47_52C1_4581_B41B_BF40C33F08E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We made our way through dark, dense woods,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nous traversâmes des bois épais et sombres,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_359143BE_5C80_42FC_B167_2C23C3273733
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d89b194469d2c808be2e6319bd4a8a0adcdedfafdc09a8a3ab6dc5d143f9944
#. default-sha256: 9b6a66aeb48d6032c52320714a9b05c7c015fc37fc3e1abc1431da97a65c1415
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_359143BE_5C80_42FC_B167_2C23C3273733"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and beyond them, like the world fading into view after a dream,⟪k:1⟫a mansion appeared "
"before us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫et, de l’autre côté, comme le monde qui revient progressivement après un songe, un manoir "
"nous apparut."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DC8ACA79_CAB1_4942_82B7_958A94631B2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e17fe26261b26dad684dffc0784377609bbbde51b8447cd01ad2d2531cff843
#. default-sha256: 0d7f842207333c6f32747f834d5699178ecb9f3fb65435af9b4c4acb72f20927
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DC8ACA79_CAB1_4942_82B7_958A94631B2D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All the windows were either shuttered or boarded, encasing the house in darkness. "
"⟪k:3⟫In a way, it felt like all I had done was move from one prison to a much larger one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Toutes les fenêtres avaient été fermées ou condamnées, plongeant la maison dans "
"les ténèbres. ⟪k:3⟫D’une certaine manière, j’eus l’impression d’avoir troqué une prison pour une "
"autre, juste bien plus grande."

#: scenario7:scenario7_07AD7681_D31A_46C2_A2B1_605FBAB4690C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4c016d9615988678371a3300988d66e972c7bb73ce2d24e1883b04242c5d089
#. default-sha256: 916266f7b3c900d7eac871ccb76eef3a60204abc128282581dff20938df1395a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_07AD7681_D31A_46C2_A2B1_605FBAB4690C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Briefly, I thought they had possibly been sealed to keep anyone from seeing me inside, but "
"my coming here was a very recent development."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’idée qu’elles avaient peut-être été condamnées pour empêcher qui que ce soit de me voir à "
"l’intérieur me traversa brièvement l’esprit, mais ma venue en cet endroit était un projet tout "
"récent."

#: scenario7:scenario7_09D5BBD6_AEEE_44A9_A23E_95B5BEA18C65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de96ebf9c8549afdd4fb2e66c6dc675a029bcba82afb556d537473e880b0f241
#. default-sha256: c9dd8a56decb5151136013404715ce64f3673242fcf580127592bbd33854dae9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_09D5BBD6_AEEE_44A9_A23E_95B5BEA18C65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫More likely, then, the house had been in this condition when it was initially purchased."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Plus vraisemblablement, la maison avait été dans cet état depuis son achat."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E5FACC8E_63AE_45FE_84F5_08E44CF718B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2b8358eba4eda9bf73f7b90c03ad2190da1c6a9751c6e824ce44cf5745e57ce
#. default-sha256: e0057a8a6af8916e3cd9676e8a64c79a19bf78d3fe71981bcbb6694f536d34f4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E5FACC8E_63AE_45FE_84F5_08E44CF718B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quite the piece of property my father had found himself with.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wondered if he had "
"been swindled by its previous owner."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Une sacrée propriété que mon père s’était trouvée.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je me demandais s’il avait été "
"arnaqué par le précédent propriétaire."

#: scenario7:scenario7_10E4132C_00D0_407E_BB98_0B0A7C2D8AAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f34d87505237ace9090d7bdd93407def24a95ee8cba2079fa28e93cda70c69f
#. default-sha256: 881da2fead5c3572c899c033c331f182cab1b491338b35524370aaf095cdba7e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_10E4132C_00D0_407E_BB98_0B0A7C2D8AAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was a gloomy, uninviting place, but it didn’t appear to be in disrepair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫L’endroit était lugubre et inhospitalier mais il n’avait pas l’air délabré."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A61028F2_141A_4513_ADDB_0512E02AD2E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a3c0b457aa697b0e91cf18a548bfc191b180b0d9056906ac84c59a0b7b14a77
