msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A85997A7_0A43_4642_A58B_D0231ACAB0AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I spent some time just staring out at the forest, but naturally, there was nothing of "
"interest to be found there. ⟪k:1⟫So I quietly turned around and opened the door to the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je passai un certain temps à fixer la forêt, mais naturellement, il n’y avait là rien "
"d’intéressant. ⟪k:1⟫Je me retournai donc doucement et ouvris la porte du manoir."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1F5B5544_F2BD_4AE1_B168_AD9BCD0A2CC4
