msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It’s certainly dark..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫C’est vrai qu’il fait noir..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A39B9906_8B03_44F8_9562_BC3F44C5F944
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8e56f8e61d59472d51de5857a7b49f7665ba9ee4fa3e07e965fa995e6990127
#. default-sha256: 5209e85f9ba4da341e3f35f73cf5d8aee1c6ec2f90d23385efdb4d37b2dd64ba
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A39B9906_8B03_44F8_9562_BC3F44C5F944"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I could barely even see my own feet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je voyais à peine mes propres pieds."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FA3122C7_CEF1_4641_81FC_8FC5C9F108D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1393509056bd3dd5b0b1e70e8a40bfb5c0859ca3d44f85425e590615d500a0f6
#. default-sha256: 11093e25b401926ad7e55f545720792ef8292c92971fde73799af721355e0c3d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FA3122C7_CEF1_4641_81FC_8FC5C9F108D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Briefly, I considered trying to unshutter a window or two, but ended up deciding against it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je songeai un temps à essayer d’ouvrir une fenêtre ou deux, mais finis par y renoncer."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6F10B502_63D0_40A0_A785_24C01EE28C1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93cd41965ee903a052a5ce9e0a43d0211a5b910a24d0387caceef3c1aa9caadb
#. default-sha256: bffc0363459f2355a6b198ca24a4a084ff53b22a8f00582fba99acfd536dfb4c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6F10B502_63D0_40A0_A785_24C01EE28C1D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The less inviting the place looked, the easier it would be for me to avoid contact with the "
"outside world, as Didier had recommended."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Moins les lieux auraient l’air accueillants, plus il me serait facile d’éviter tout contact "
"avec le monde extérieur, comme Didier me l’avait recommandé."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0E767C7_7129_413F_9DE2_47181008E1FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ded417fa9612faa1f19928a5c1e92e086108b128aeb573a19644b2a17956129b
#. default-sha256: e8210d5e17dbdef038494e948d57a62e6f8a140b4a49880b0ca036b9ab361194
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0E767C7_7129_413F_9DE2_47181008E1FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Standing there in the darkness for several minutes, my eyes gradually grew accustomed to the "
"lack of light. ⟪k:1⟫While it was hardly ideal, it was sufficient to take a look around the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Au bout d’un moment à rester dans le noir, mes yeux s’habituèrent peu à peu au manque de "
"lumière. ⟪k:1⟫C’était loin d’être l’idéal, certes, mais c’était suffisant pour jeter un œil aux "
"alentours."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9CE09A1E_68E6_4052_BB90_4836A61A2BFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cde08aec8fbd19b8ec4a84896642a14b629702c06e964e67b149d803c377bdc4
#. default-sha256: 937da7a4f77c611724365c30bd6c63676efd8421f59c4a323883dc317931d41e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9CE09A1E_68E6_4052_BB90_4836A61A2BFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The inside didn’t seem to have received the same level of care as the outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"everything was dusty and the air was many years stale. ⟪k:3⟫But I wasn’t in a cleaning mood,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On eût dit que l’intérieur n’avait pas reçu les mêmes soins que l’extérieur —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ tout "
"était recouvert de poussière et cela sentait le renfermé de longue date. ⟪k:3⟫Mais je n’étais pas "
"d’humeur à faire du ménage,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_776F7F6F_F659_4AD0_AFE7_A4C0D33DD587
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1133c00967bfeb360229d778c7e69c5ce4e729fbd046ac13b43333510d4bc7cf
