"⟪k:0⟫The archangel—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫after whom I had been named—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫looked solemnly down upon me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’archange —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ celui à l’origine de mon nom —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ me fixait avec solennité."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BD94362B_1353_4109_AA78_C4B97929DB77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: deddf5a86b432884bd1b94242c28b297e1f8270be56f6a4346cc1a8c38cb0a1b
