msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With every step I took, I could hear my joints creaking and my muscles screaming. ⟪k:1⟫I was "
"long since out of breath, only staying upright with the help of the wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ chaque pas que je faisais, j’entendais mes articulations protester et mes "
"muscles hurler. ⟪k:3⟫J’étais à bout de souffle depuis longtemps et me maintenais uniquement grâce "
"au soutien du mur."

