msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It didn’t look like it had been put there recently either, as much of it was rotted through."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et ça ne semblait pas dater d’hier, vu comme la majeure partie d’entre elles avait pourri."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C3AC18F6_58B8_4279_8235_3EA9E83F1946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 985d7c805c0864c8882efccb23422c9e854d5c5a87231b234b6d35057f40be21
