msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫People only sealed doors like this for a reason.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Largely because they didn’t want—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫or couldn’t allow—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫others to see what hid behind them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les gens scellaient seulement les portes comme celle-ci pour une raison précise.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La "
"plupart du temps parce qu’ils ne voulaient pas —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ ou ne pouvaient se permettre —⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫ que d’autres voient ce qui se cachait derrière."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EFBE9BDB_947B_4FC3_9618_3B24BBCEDAF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3b9c563f4107fd9e8034b6e1711c1e02f5dac75073c08238967669f77c75283
#. default-sha256: 75321e4b1e9a68920b90ff0f5303e7d45344dc7329a24e62aa1d76290931610d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EFBE9BDB_947B_4FC3_9618_3B24BBCEDAF3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Like... ⟪k:1⟫what they did to me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Comme... ⟪k:1⟫ce qu’ils m’ont fait..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_728A6837_89EF_4241_B76C_9F3FEAF28F75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f40513ff234ce3a604e4d7420b292a455c11771000e05f1b5a31a67aa2053ee0
#. default-sha256: 92719b5e4a8a7452a0fdea4597f72053a08666b1860910b6eb9c363b50dc155f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_728A6837_89EF_4241_B76C_9F3FEAF28F75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For a few moments, I felt as though I was looking down at myself from outside my body."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’eus alors le sentiment de me contempler depuis l’extérieur, comme si j’étais en dehors de "
"mon corps."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B5C26BBE_5178_4E85_A329_F553B3539AEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b5440193770574fc6a66e888a7785f9f761363e3131843e8ffed55743140554
#. default-sha256: 3eec8afe1716fe899e08f342f1c898e1b6ff49b049856dd83366b806dca93b77
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B5C26BBE_5178_4E85_A329_F553B3539AEC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If it hadn’t been this man, but someone else standing there, would they have turned back at "
"the sight of the sealed-off door, acting as though nothing was there?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si ça n’avait pas été moi mais quelqu’un d’autre à ma place, est-ce qu’il aurait tourné les "
"talons en voyant cette porte scellée, est-ce qu’il aurait fait comme si de rien n’était ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_79C85BEE_7A70_41D5_AC66_0C21C8DFCBED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a238f9d93c4a060501450a6b356df83827606193a3671ff816327323df3a3d2
#. default-sha256: c065667df7f143f5234afe6b5da947470a9673dbb6d6155dd014063d0c449ea2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_79C85BEE_7A70_41D5_AC66_0C21C8DFCBED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or would they have done as I did?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ou bien est-ce qu’il aurait fait comme moi ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B8A8FA78_1517_45D2_9C5B_A93BEE0D427E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0342031f371a38cd407a08ed912f86e202ea77416550048466f924ae5c1716f5
#. default-sha256: 634ac32e1b93ccf67649a5075636b94aeb4be97fd6b37f700a3ad97a2e0a0212
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B8A8FA78_1517_45D2_9C5B_A93BEE0D427E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I ground my teeth, a mix of annoyance and bitterness rushing through me. ⟪k:1⟫But I did not "
"hesitate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je serrai les dents en sentant un mélange de colère et d’amertume m’envahir. ⟪k:1⟫Mais je "
"n’hésitai pas."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A78D05F7_6C43_432D_9E44_98144973FE40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f733bc75deaf6084bc1b4ef5beb57195de4a424ede6935a306fe120444c00b7
#. default-sha256: 722585a8e5863b32bccc1013499a5d6dcd899a7656f557f2774e433a289c0987
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A78D05F7_6C43_432D_9E44_98144973FE40"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I held the flame of the candle up to the wall of rope, careful not to set the whole thing "
"ablaze, slowly, carefully burning through them one by one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je tins la flamme de la bougie contre le mur de cordes en faisant attention à ne pas tout "
"embraser, en les brûlant une par une lentement, prudemment."

#: scenario7:scenario7_24A6F4EE_AA47_44AA_999F_D6B8D99FA06A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1290f51de99dc6c5b717278b8b22dcde474efd2fb078d2d157ace9a2163182f
#. default-sha256: 5b64e9f3b197a5c8ed5c29b442c3b48f22419e79eb1ad1c0f9c53aff5f91a893
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_24A6F4EE_AA47_44AA_999F_D6B8D99FA06A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was repetitive and time-consuming, but I persisted, wiping away sheets of sweat before it "
"streamed into my eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était une activité répétitive, qui prenait du temps, mais je persévérai, tout en essuyant "
"la sueur qui coulait entre mes yeux."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FAA81D06_4D31_4A9D_9403_1BA0C235AE10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 852bb19f159056e0bc159709191b06926db640d0c5d9a16c9ccbbac288f326dd
#. default-sha256: 92d26567b3e8b4dc421ec5796ff7b1f34f245f87ebd22f791ae90c6e8d590f03
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FAA81D06_4D31_4A9D_9403_1BA0C235AE10"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sun was well on its way down before I finally managed to expose the door."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le soleil était sur le point de se coucher quand je réussis enfin à libérer la porte."

