msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Probably not very much..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Probablement pas beaucoup..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_51EE7D7E_C2F2_4960_B156_BC5FD7AB4C4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14639af5a7b16bc1a9d5ddadd91cbd9d9bd713e84c2e148b3d0115fdbf81dbc9
#. default-sha256: f80891db1f8141886a5d50dcfeb39b1bf7e8b27e3c1bfb8e707ae05087ae5d15
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_51EE7D7E_C2F2_4960_B156_BC5FD7AB4C4F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I spent enough time alone in that dark mansion to drive anyone mad."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Le temps que je passai seul dans ce sombre manoir aurait suffi à rendre fou "
"n’importe qui."

#: scenario7:scenario7_728DAE21_C534_4503_A197_67DA6AB13F39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27d675cb7df0f07143f89f4528288993681936f621efba7da87e9938d29f6851
#. default-sha256: 67f8512605d7f72df2975f4b2269a69bc96d3d7083ddff434250b65e21067a29
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_728DAE21_C534_4503_A197_67DA6AB13F39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more time that passed, the more I grew to question myself—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫my worth as a "
"human being."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Plus le temps passait, plus je doutais de moi —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫de ma valeur en tant qu’être "
"humain."

#: scenario7:scenario7_05DCCE77_2C9B_446E_A26A_9A2D2037DAA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e3a1d2c2d724f4627dedcb26a9511f8db318f47cbd172e659c4d6da5c9a1054
#. default-sha256: b623c711300bd814811d95c24fe9c094ef848b8da085a5fd7f0d645f4c931279
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_05DCCE77_2C9B_446E_A26A_9A2D2037DAA0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And whenever the self-doubt and -loathing became too much to take...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I trekked up "
"to the top of the observation tower to see the light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et à chaque fois que le doute et la haine de moi menaçaient de m’emporter...⟪k:1⟫ je montais "
"jusqu’au sommet de la tour d’observation pour voir la lumière."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D9A599E4_1F98_4751_8132_4181FBE29AA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07ffa315a061c2b4de4c85b8956b344110bafe9ba8c367fb5b14a8f922770fae
#. default-sha256: 65932c3b9f5ad7f8bfe654a8ff429eca7a9bcd3337b1a8db181120840d811330
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D9A599E4_1F98_4751_8132_4181FBE29AA6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sitting there on the hard floor, I would place my hand on the skeleton’s leg, its "
"shoulder, its hand. ⟪k:2⟫From the size of the bones, whoever it was appeared to have still been "
"young when their life withered away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je m’asseyais sur le sol dur et je posais les mains sur la jambe du squelette, sur son "
"épaule, sur sa main. ⟪k:2⟫D’après la taille des os, cette personne semblait avoir été encore "
"jeune quand la vie l’avait quittée."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4ECEF7B3_D973_4233_85E1_87C934AF2AA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 898b5ac09220b297a64ed88e2a29653e62e206b00bb75f8061f64dfee789f5af
#. default-sha256: 84df89d932199253b470662da827fd994093b3c21513f3cb525fba9f75fa7ca9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4ECEF7B3_D973_4233_85E1_87C934AF2AA4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Poor child."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Pauvre enfant."

#: scenario7:scenario7_ABA3EF0D_6DD3_46A7_A76A_8ABEA1DCD8A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78dad1b3d82b7158197749e3b2fefdb42fc8f3a99a0a4af8efe9cc2a17876c48
#. default-sha256: 60f7b6f5b1c77299708c15d54336c1426ede7d06d4e36ed7c1dcc0876ead8ccc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ABA3EF0D_6DD3_46A7_A76A_8ABEA1DCD8A8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Even I feel blessed... ⟪k:1⟫compared to you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Même moi, je me sens béni... ⟪k:1⟫comparé à toi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1044E7B9_BCB3_4E2A_B1D2_004CBC09D103
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb7a2b067e547db25d4a42c47d05bb883bac0802fea4888090d10ec972563327
#. default-sha256: 5e6514fefffaefeb4754e0451d11b5892ed500f82365c767c19e68d1f9e55545
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1044E7B9_BCB3_4E2A_B1D2_004CBC09D103"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, how miserable it must have been, locked away up in this tower... ⟪k:1⟫To have your arm "
"mercilessly severed..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, comme tu as dû souffrir, enfermé dans cette tour... ⟪k:1⟫Avec ton bras coupé sans "
"pitié..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_435D196C_FC86_482D_888C_DCE33D0A36D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e6cf8a18a53aa94a4a32fe84bb6babd4c1c619a1bc806b6920d6419f7e063da
#. default-sha256: 8cb9e21c25a1f08008956a59a0d84d02bb34a9fb7bb6fb92d8ded106172fb529
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_435D196C_FC86_482D_888C_DCE33D0A36D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You have my pity, though."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Moi, ma pitié, tu l’as."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CADE1978_894F_4C1B_AB07_9C71BA262DE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 419ef4b1c964c9d8d0c964de034813e2d49fbeef8a081432403195db02426a0a
