msgid "⟪k:0⟫I alone shall mourn your death..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Moi seul pleurerai ta mort..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C7F4B452_3CA5_46CA_949D_B73906C73C27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bed00fc20f64fad955594174fc7103a77749cb0bf7ade6af3a0b7dca430c5da4
