msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_96B56A77_61D9_4AA0_BFE4_6796DF8CC00E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You poor, poor child..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh mon pauvre, pauvre enfant..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BF1AC9D6_9718_4DAF_BFD3_48556B9C60B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ea6c5e21ded315d0fddbc80ccebeb0b577ed2cced40f195a627531466d190d8
#. default-sha256: 39f7ba37e16386d5d1b263f6b35e390c88b7d453fd3309a6cf1a41ff368449f0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BF1AC9D6_9718_4DAF_BFD3_48556B9C60B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By pretending to pity someone who had had it worse than me,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was able to feel "
"somewhat better about myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En faisant semblant de prendre en pitié quelqu’un qui avait vécu pire que moi,⟪k:1⟫ je me "
"forgeais l’illusion que tout allait un peu mieux en ce qui me concernait."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D6E3C3D0_3678_4356_9740_08C969B3AC41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e05ed35d014d83b58b25b8ad7bd5953482b41dd77cb3b69f044a44a6d90766eb
#. default-sha256: 46f5bf0771e7295bf925f5ac593d722c5b412c5edcbd240b704eb69fe6f9cf5d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D6E3C3D0_3678_4356_9740_08C969B3AC41"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Because if I was in a position to pity someone else..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Parce que si j’étais en position de prendre en pitié quelqu’un d’autre..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_394AC233_87A7_4B95_AC22_51DFA34BE575
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 906e73deb35d7e09bab30db574150cb26b3b2390a6af77687dde61714fac6f76
#. default-sha256: 8e12ec00459cf0d2bcf88c5c1d5b3aa3042f1e6b0493ab0c50867dedd69f9417
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_394AC233_87A7_4B95_AC22_51DFA34BE575"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then, conversely, I wasn’t in a position to be pitied."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...alors, inversement, je n’étais pas en position d’être pris en pitié."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A62B01D_C5D7_479F_B57A_FA5817CCAE90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0ee8f4154d79557fefb89b74da8c641bf78a6ce58f958fe3e2db6cf015a964b
#. default-sha256: 707e66c744d2f25ab664a331fca3c6e7e1949369f36503d01d97f0223ee1eff3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5A62B01D_C5D7_479F_B57A_FA5817CCAE90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vainly, foolishly trying to convince myself of a lie, ⟪k:1⟫I spent hours, days alone in that "
"tower, holding the dry bones in my arms."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vainement, en essayant de façon absurde de me convaincre de ce mensonge, ⟪k:1⟫je passais des "
"heures seul dans la tour, à serrer les os desséchés dans mes bras."

#: scenario7:scenario7_128D6A9B_FB57_4B56_80B9_F881B062ADB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6640a32e6798ccd8e98c5b46ba9dfbc6f0ea347a8b3e04e1228e15bfb1fdb05
#. default-sha256: 838e746cc7f08fd7e262d607b640af74d24359816a7a52e9d4060fb29877398d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_128D6A9B_FB57_4B56_80B9_F881B062ADB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now ⟪k:1⟫there⟪k:2⟫ was a sight to lend credence to my alleged madness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Voilà⟪k:2⟫ enfin un comportement qui prêtait foi à ma prétendue folie."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4554714D_65B4_4285_811D_1E3501781375
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1cc281ee476ab6e98cdcc28b66e491d7c7be7ae88bd967e1152ca8acab7ab9f5
