msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4554714D_65B4_4285_811D_1E3501781375"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Over time, the air in the mansion seemed to thicken, as if the fog were "
"condensing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Avec le temps, l’air du manoir parut s’épaissir, comme si le brouillard "
"s’était condensé."

#: scenario7:scenario7_211FFB6A_7150_4C87_A8C7_A56CC109025D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d8698a9ef260885c5c6d707c74eff7dfdad5f58e0a942f424c55dcf036342df
