msgid "⟪k:0⟫Soon, I lost track of the passage of time,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Puis, je perdis la notion du temps,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0C7D4475_58AB_4D37_8F46_1722EF08F21E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
