#: scenario7:scenario7_54635564_D0A1_42D8_9D79_1E85F13D74C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04f99990a5d6bd1c330f0c8e865591edfd6dadbac967e09e5d5fb83014363c5b
